/target
**/target/
# cargo-ndk output, regenerated by the build
/android/jniLibs/
# agent worktrees. The worktree directory only, not the whole of `.claude/`:
# checked-in project config belongs beside it and ignoring the parent would
# silently swallow it.
/.claude/worktrees/
# Per-developer permission state, which is personal and never shared. Narrowing
# the rule above exposed this file, and it stayed invisible here only because
# one machine happened to carry `**/.claude/settings.local.json` in a global
# ignore. A machine-local config is not a guard the repository can rely on.
# `settings.json`, the shared project config, is deliberately still trackable.
/.claude/settings.local.json
